<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-1259] toString() method of SequentialAccessSparseVector has closing brace missing for empty vector</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1259</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;toString() method of SequentialAccessSparseVector.java in Math module did not have closing brace for empty vectors. If the sparse vector is empty (or newly created), toString() method should return &apos;{}&apos;. Currently it returns &apos;{&apos;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12652549">MAHOUT-1259</key>
