                            <comment id="13681865" author="abhinavkulkarni" created="Thu, 13 Jun 2013 02:49:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;In the toString() method of SequentialAccessSparseVector.java, there is a check that adds closing brace &apos;}&apos; only if the vector is non-empty. It should add this brace regardless of whether vector is empty or not.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13681867" author="robinanil" created="Thu, 13 Jun 2013 02:50:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I dont see any patches attached&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
